These weights were produced by continual pretraining of a Nucleotide Transformer v3
checkpoint released by InstaDeep (https://huggingface.co/InstaDeepAI). They are a
derivative of that model and inherit its terms. The base model is distributed under
the InstaDeep Open Model Licence, Version 1.0:

    https://huggingface.co/InstaDeepAI/NTv3_650M_post/blob/main/MODEL-LICENSE.md

